<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Reform of Australia FBT a priority-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Reform of Australia FBT a priority-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Monday reform of the Australian fringe benefits tax system would be a priority over the next year.</p>
<p>Costello repeated that the Liberal-National Coalition did not plan to introduce a goods and services tax (GST) and that its 1996/97 budget announced last week would lead to a more benign interest rate climate.</p>
</text>
